# Title: Suspicious Network Connection Binary No CommandLine
# ID: 20384606-a124-4fec-acbb-8bd373728613
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-07-03
# Tags: attack.stealth
# Description: Detects suspicious network connections made by a well-known Windows binary run with no command line parameters
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog ((Initiated="true" AND (process_path="*\\regsvr32.exe" OR process_path="*\\rundll32.exe" OR process_path="*\\dllhost.exe") AND (process_exec="*\\regsvr32.exe" OR process_exec="*\\rundll32.exe" OR process_exec="*\\dllhost.exe")) AND NOT (((process_exec="") OR (NOT process_exec=*))))
